#   - Values easily changeable for different test scenarios
#   - Can create multiple .env files (.env, .env.test, .env.prod)
#
# ✓ Architecture
#   - Follows 12-factor app principles
#   - Configuration separate from code
#   - Supports dev/test/prod variations
#
# ✓ Security
#   - No secrets in git (file should be in .gitignore)
#   - Passwords generated outside of templates
#   - Secrets management options documented
#
# ✓ Business Value
#   - Easy to replicate deployment
#   - Tuning guidance for different hardware
#   - Production-ready examples
#
# ✓ Documentation
#   - Comprehensive comments for each variable
#   - Examples and best practices
#   - Performance tuning recommendations
#
# ============================================================================

